{"task_id": "calc_018", "category": "calculator", "condition": "no_react", "rep": 0, "answer": "Here is the calculation for the average speed:\n\n1. **Convert the time to hours:**\n   * 3 hours and 45 minutes.\n   * 45 minutes $\\div$ 60 minutes/hour = 0.75 hours.\n   * Total time = $3 + 0.75 = 3.75$ hours.\n\n2. **Calculate the average speed:**\n   * Speed = Distance / Time\n   * Speed = $312 \\text{ km} / 3.75 \\text{ hours}$\n   * Speed = $83.2 \\text{ km/h}$\n\nThe average speed of the train is **83.2 km/h**.", "tool_calls": [], "steps": 1, "latency": 4.502, "error": null, "run_date": "2026-10-10", "auto_correct": true}
