{"task_id": "calc_028", "category": "calculator", "condition": "no_react", "rep": 0, "answer": "You can choose 5 items from 12 in **792** ways.\n\nThis is calculated using the combination formula:\n$$\\binom{n}{k} = \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$$\nWhere $n=12$ and $k=5$:\n$$\\binom{12}{5} = \\frac{12!}{5!(12-5)!} = \\frac{12!}{5!7!} = \\frac{12 \\times 11 \\times 10 \\times 9 \\times 8}{5 \\times 4 \\times 3 \\times 2 \\times 1} = 792$$", "tool_calls": [], "steps": 1, "latency": 4.273, "error": null, "run_date": "2026-10-10", "auto_correct": true}
